// AWS IAM Administrator/Wildcard Policy Attached  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1098.003
// Detects attachment of the AWS managed AdministratorAccess policy to a user, role, or group. Matches the well-known admin policy ARN; custom…
// False positives: Deliberate granting of administrator access (should be rare and reviewed).
// Source: rules/privilege-escalation/iam-attach-administrator-policy.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^AttachUserPolicy$/i or eventName=/^AttachRolePolicy$/i or eventName=/^AttachGroupPolicy$/i eventSource=/^iam\.amazonaws\.com$/i requestParameters.policyArn=/AdministratorAccess/i
